  "summary_lines": [
    "[NOTICE OK] 02:59 on the civil November 11 keeps the previous assignments",
    "[NOTICE OK] no early boundary rounding",
    "[NOTICE OK] 03:00 exactly applies the revised list and leaves WOR unchanged",
    "[NOTICE OK] shared frequency makes no invented programme or on-air claim",
    "[NOTICE OK] legacy schedule doy is not the event calendar",
    "[NOTICE OK] late arrival and resolver reconstruction preserve the same dated copy",
    "[NOTICE OK] missing civil time never falls back to the host clock or a guessed date",
    "[NOTICE OK] nonfinite civil time cannot select an assignment",
    "[NOTICE OK] the production board mounts a separately reachable notice control",
    "[NOTICE OK] the printed paper owns its inspection ray, not the old board rectangle",
    "[NOTICE OK] the actual hand control reaches the existing service-wire presenter",
    "[NOTICE OK] the paper keeps both printed columns instead of rewriting at the boundary",
    "[NOTICE OK] reading neither grants global NPC knowledge nor advances campaign time",
    "[NOTICE OK] the notice reuses the paper tap and adds no alleged historical broadcast",
    "[NOTICE OK] a neighboring board owns live paper-tap playback",
    "[NOTICE OK] retiring one board preserves its live neighbor's playback and stream",
    "[NOTICE OK] the final board releases its decoder resource without a global cache purge",
    "[HISTORICAL RADIO NOTICE] RESULT: PASS (17/17)"
  ],
